    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 110,
      "npc" : "Mad Scientist",
      "text" : "The Mad Scientist doesn't seem to notice you and keeps mumbling to himself..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 114,
      "npc" : "Mad Scientist",
      "text" : "[Mad Scientist]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 115,
      "npc" : "Mad Scientist",
      "text" : "Haha, no Orcs are coming near me!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 116,
      "npc" : "Mad Scientist",
      "text" : "The power of the Dimensional Gorge is undefeatable!!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 118,
      "npc" : "Mad Scientist",
      "text" : "Orcs don't attack you?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 118,
      "npc" : "Mad Scientist",
      "text" : "You wish!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 120,
      "npc" : "Mad Scientist",
      "text" : "[Mad Scientist]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 121,
      "npc" : "Mad Scientist",
      "text" : "Yeah, yeah.. I know it's hard to belive. I don't blame ya."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 122,
      "npc" : "Mad Scientist",
      "text" : "I used to study the Dimensional Gorge discovered near Morocc."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 123,
      "npc" : "Mad Scientist",
      "text" : "According to my research, the minerals found there have enormous power inside them!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 127,
      "npc" : "Mad Scientist",
      "text" : "[Mad Scientist]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 128,
      "npc" : "Mad Scientist",
      "text" : "You are a pretty distrustful person, huh?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 132,
      "npc" : "Mad Scientist",
      "text" : "Oh? Like what, travel to alternate space?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 133,
      "npc" : "Mad Scientist",
      "text" : "[Mad Scientist]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 134,
      "npc" : "Mad Scientist",
      "text" : "Very smart! I have actually just done that! See that statue over there? It's not your normal Monolith!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 136,
      "npc" : "Mad Scientist",
      "text" : "[Mad Scientist]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 137,
      "npc" : "Mad Scientist",
      "text" : "I have created it with a combination of our technology and the unlimited energy I discovered from the Gorge! Want to try it?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 139,
      "npc" : "Mad Scientist",
      "text" : "...Um, that doesn't sound legal?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 140,
      "npc" : "Mad Scientist",
      "text" : "[Mad Scientist]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 141,
      "npc" : "Mad Scientist",
      "text" : "Hey, since when did something so interesting have to be legal!? How about it! You can talk to the Orcs! C'mon!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 143,
      "npc" : "Mad Scientist",
      "text" : "[Mad Scientist]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 144,
      "npc" : "Mad Scientist",
      "text" : "Chances are they'll just give you lots of instructions once they see you, so just wing it! They're always saying the same thing, to the point where I memorized them!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 146,
      "npc" : "Mad Scientist",
      "text" : "Alright... What do I do?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 146,
      "npc" : "Mad Scientist",
      "text" : "Umm, maybe not."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 148,
      "npc" : "Mad Scientist",
      "text" : "[Mad Scientist]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 149,
      "npc" : "Mad Scientist",
      "text" : "Very good! Just sit in the hands of this statue! And try to act natural when you're in there!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 153,
      "npc" : "Mad Scientist",
      "text" : "[Mad Scientist]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 154,
      "npc" : "Mad Scientist",
      "text" : "Oh fine, be that way!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 158,
      "npc" : "Mad Scientist",
      "text" : "[Mad Scientist]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 159,
      "npc" : "Mad Scientist",
      "text" : "Hmm? Put your hand on that Monemus Statue if you want to experience traveling through dimensions!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 870,
      "npc" : "Kruger",
      "text" : "[Kruger]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 871,
      "npc" : "Kruger",
      "text" : "*Coughing*"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 872,
      "npc" : "Kruger",
      "placeholders" : [
        "strcharinfo(0)"
      ],
      "text" : "{0}, it's you..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 874,
      "npc" : "Kruger",
      "placeholders" : [
        "strcharinfo(0)"
      ],
      "text" : "[{0}] "
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 875,
      "npc" : "Kruger",
      "text" : "Don't move! You are wounded!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 877,
      "npc" : "Kruger",
      "text" : "[Kruger]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 878,
      "npc" : "Kruger",
      "text" : "It's... all right.. I'm dying..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 879,
      "npc" : "Kruger",
      "text" : "...."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 880,
      "npc" : "Kruger",
      "text" : "The Shaman? What about the Shaman?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 882,
      "npc" : "Kruger",
      "placeholders" : [
        "strcharinfo(0)"
      ],
      "text" : "[{0}] "
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 883,
      "npc" : "Kruger",
      "text" : "The Shaman's dead now. Who was that Shaman really?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 885,
      "npc" : "Kruger",
      "text" : "Kruger seemed to be relieved as he hears of the death of the Shaman, but you notice the bitter expression on his face."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 887,
      "npc" : "Kruger",
      "text" : "[Kruger]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 888,
      "npc" : "Kruger",
      "text" : "I.. I just couldn't kill my own daughter..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 889,
      "npc" : "Kruger",
      "text" : "Thank you, I'm sure she's finally free from the nightmare that used to choke her soul."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 891,
      "npc" : "Kruger",
      "text" : "Kruger was about to say something more, but he breathed his last breath before he could..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 896,
      "npc" : "Kruger",
      "text" : "You can see the dead body of Kruger, peacefully lying on the ground."
    }
  ]
